      "rdfs:label": "member",
      "skos:example": "The fabula of Battle of Hogwarts in Harry Potter and the Deathly Hallows orders events as follows:\nrdf:_1 Voldemort casts the \"Avada Kedavra\" curse.\nrdf:_2 Harry casts \"Expelliarmus\"\nrdf:_3 The spells collide in midair, etc."
    },
    {
      "@id": "golem:GP0i_is_feature_of",
