        "The topic assignment for Harry Potter and the Philosopher's Stone (E13) assigned attribute to the work Harry Potter and the Philosopher's Stone (Rowling, 1997) (F1)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "dlp_temp:temporally-overlaps",
      "@type": "owl:ObjectProperty",
      "rdfs:comment": "In GOLEM, indicates that two narrative events (G5) or psychological states (G3) overlap at some point in time.",
      "rdfs:label": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "temporally overlaps"
      },
      "skos:example": "Ron’s jealousy (G3) temporally overlaps with Hermione’s arrival at the ball with Viktor Krum (G5)."
