        {
          "@id": "_:n3550b387edeb40d59b2f372a3e7c0289b68"
        }
      ],
      "skos:example": "Romantic love between Ron and Hermione, which can be inferred from the paragraph below:\n\"There was a clatter as the basilisk fangs cascaded out of Hermione’s arms. Running at Ron, she flung them around his neck and kissed him full on the mouth. Ron threw away the fangs and broomstick he was holding and responded with such enthusiasm that he lifted Hermione off her feet\" (chapter 31 in Harry Potter and the Deathly Hallows)."
    },
